      "confidence": {
        "level": "MEDIUM",
        "rationale": "All mandatory evidence is LIVE, the issuer record is still current, and the before, after and head multiplier reads plus the activation scan passed the desk's checks, including activation on schedule. One non-core plausibility check, whether the rebase size is consistent with net cashflow per share against a reference price, remains UNKNOWN because no price evidence was collected, which holds confidence below HIGH."
      },
      "unknowns": [
        "CHK-REBASE-SIZE-PLAUSIBLE is UNKNOWN: the desk could not test whether the rebase size is consistent with net cashflow per share, because the check needs a reference price and an explicit net cashflow figure that this evidence set does not contain.",
        "No reference price evidence was collected, so the implied rebase percentage at the current price is not established for this asset.",
        "The proof-of-reserves record is issuer-reported through the issuer API; nothing in this evidence independently attests to the shares held at the custodian.",
        "The reason the multiplier moved is taken from the issuer's corporate-action classification (CashDividend); no cash-distribution legs or holder-level entitlements were observed on-chain."
      ],
      "conflicts": [],
      "limitations": [
        "This investigation covers one X Layer deployment of DTEx; other chains where the token may be issued were not read on-chain, and the issuer's all-chain supply figures are taken as reported.",
        "On-chain multiplier reads are point-in-time RPC observations, and the issuer API and trading-status items carry short cache windows after which they go stale.",
        "No Transfer-event log sweep was carried out, so the absence of Transfer events around the rebase is inferred from how a multiplier change works rather than demonstrated from logs.",
        "The activation scan used a bounded block search around the effective time, so it dates activation to a block but does not measure sub-block ordering against the issuer's timestamp.",
        "No holder-level balance snapshots were taken, so the practical effect on any single account's effective balance was not measured."
      ]
